  "name": "dbt",
  "keywords": "dbt MCP Server helps users inspect dbt projects, query dbt Semantic Layer metrics, review lineage and model metadata, run dbt commands, manage dbt Platform jobs, generate dbt boilerplate, and search official dbt documentation through ChatGPT.",
